# Exp4: always build and push

Do not stop at source edits. After changing `applications/exp4/`:

1. Read `DEFAULT_IMAGE_TAG` / `DEFAULT_IMAGE_TAG_S2` in `applications/exp4/exp4_deploy.sh`.
2. Build and push (lab registry `10.1.132.30:5000`):

```bash
IMAGE_TAG=<s1/s3/s4/s5 tag> ./applications/exp4/build_images.sh --push s1 s3 s4 s5
IMAGE_TAG=<s2 tag> ./applications/exp4/build_images.sh --push s2
```

If both tags match: `IMAGE_TAG=<tag> ./applications/exp4/build_images.sh --push`

3. Deploy so pods pull the new tag (`imagePullPolicy: Always`):

```bash
./applications/exp4/exp4_deploy.sh
```

Or only the slices that changed: `./applications/exp4/exp4_deploy.sh s2`
